        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The example in Figure 34 shows two V2G communication sessions separated by a pause period and a standby period during the latter V2G communication session, illustrating their relation over time to the TCP/TLS connections, the data link establishment, the service session, and the power transfer between EV and EVSE.",
