        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "An EV or EVSE may want to change the charging service or the prior agreed charging schedule in the same communication session, therefore the \"renegotiation\" concept is introduced. Two types of renegotiation are set. The first one is the \"ServiceRenegotiation\" as a means to change the charging service. The second one is the \"ScheduleRenegotiation\" as an option to change the prior agreed schedules. For further information see Annex F.",
